      "value": "Here's another post with the same issue: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/when-using-bluetooth-device-on-meta-2-headset-audio-cuts-out-randomly-with-lag. It's been marked as \"Not a Bug\", which is pretty confusing because it completely breaks Bluetooth earbuds on the Quest 2. Hopefully this gets some attention soon.",
